{%- elif kind == 'not-measured' and failure.dropped.value == 'restarted' %}its candidate was never measured: the run restarted and could not resume its work; its code is kept
{%- elif kind == 'not-measured' %}its candidate was never measured: the run stopped first; its code is kept
{%- elif kind == 'merge-refused' %}the merger refused to merge; its reason is in the merge's record
